  "text_md": "![](<0dd31f954c25db440baccc3245daf51b4b55_page_2_pg1_images/imageFile1.png>)\n\n![](<0dd31f954c25db440baccc3245daf51b4b55_page_2_pg1_images/imageFile2.png>)\n\nISARS\n\n![](<0dd31f954c25db440baccc3245daf51b4b55_page_2_pg1_images/imageFile3.png>)\n\nCluster of Excellence\n\nCafoscani\n\nASIA AND EUROPE\n\n![](<0dd31f954c25db440baccc3245daf51b4b55_page_2_pg1_images/imageFile4.png>)\n\nVenezia\n\nIN A GLOBAL CONTEXT\n\nUCC\n\n![](<0dd31f954c25db440baccc3245daf51b4b55_page_2_pg1_images/imageFile5.png>)\n\n![](<0dd31f954c25db440baccc3245daf51b4b55_page_2_pg1_images/imageFile6.png>)\n\népeuvas\n\nColálste na hOllscoile Corcaigh; Eire\n\n# Programme 27th April\n\n9.30   10.00: Greetings and introduction to the workshop ( Athina Athanasiou , Chair of Department of Social Anthropology, Eleana Yalouri , Director of the Laboratory for Anthropological Research   For the Organizers: Diana Riboli , ISARS President, Lidia Guzy, University of Cork)  \n\n# Session I\n\nChair: Lidia Guzy\n\n10.00   10.40: Stefano Beggiora     The Khonds and\n\nthe Jungle: A Case Study on Indigenous India Davide Torri  \n\n10.40 11.20: Davide Torri Panteion University of Social & Political Sciences Department of Social Anthropology\n\nAlive: Human, Non-human and Landscape in the (Buddhist) Himalayas\n\n11.20   11.40 Coffee Break  \n\n11.40   12.20 Ivan Tacey     Rearranging\n\nCosmic Relations: Cosmopolitics in the Anthropocene\n\n12.20 -13.20 Discussion\n\n13.30 - 14. 30 Lunch Break Session II Chair: Naran Bilik\n\n14.30   15.10 Taj Khan Kalash   Ecological Living\n\nin Peril: The Case of Kalasha Society in Hindu Kush\n\n15.10   15.50 Lu Fangfang   The Making\n\nof Shaman among the Three Northern Minorities in China and the Hero s Theme Ranju Hasini Sahoo  \n\n15.50 16.30 Ranju Hasini Sahoo\n\nEco Cosmology and Sacred Complex\n\n16.30   17.30 Discussion  \n\n# 28th April\n\nSession I Chair: Stefano Beggiora  \n\n10.00  10.40: Naran Bilik   Unblocking\n\nthe Blockage between Earth and Heaven: Shamanism as Cultural Intimacy in China\n\n",
